 "measures": [
  {
   "name": "Public Measure US (Van Buren County Community School District)",
   "jurisdiction": "Van Buren County Community School District (Van Buren, Davis, Henry, Lee counties)",
   "ballotLanguage": "Shall the Board of Directors of the Van Buren County Community School District in the Counties of Van Buren, Davis, Henry and Lee, State of Iowa, be authorized to issue approximately $13,800,000 School Infrastructure Sales, Services and Use Tax Revenue and Refunding Bonds, which may be issued in one or more series over multiple fiscal years pursuant to Iowa Code Section 423F.2 and 423E.5, in the approximate amount of $13,800,000 for the purpose of providing funds to build, furnish, and equip an addition to the Keosauqua campus, including a secure entrance, classrooms, commons, and office space, and to improve the site; and to currently refund the outstanding School Infrastructure Sales, Services and Use Tax Revenue Bonds, Series 2022A, dated July 15, 2022, including costs of issuance and a debt service reserve fund if required by the purchaser; with any bond proceeds remaining after completion of this project used for other school infrastructure projects as authorized by the School District's Revenue Purpose Statement?"
  }
 ],
 "notes": "Source: Lee County Auditor's official 'Notice of General Election' PDF (certified by Auditor Sherri Yasenchok), retrieved via Firecrawl because leecountyiowa.gov / leecounty.iowa.gov / leecounty.org return Cloudflare 403 challenges to curl. Supervisors are elected by district - voters see only their district (Districts 2 and 3 up in 2026). The notice lists candidates only, without vote-for counts, so 'seats' is null for trustee, SWCD and Ag Extension contests (clerk = 1). 'No Candidate' contests are recorded with empty candidate arrays, including To Fill a Vacancy trustee races in Charleston, Denmark and West Point townships. Party for county offices from the notice's (D)/(R) labels. Marked partial because sample ballots (vote-for counts, precinct assignment of the measure) could not be fetched; the 'Official General Election Ballot' (docid=29749) was also blocked. Tried: https://www.leecountyiowa.gov/, https://www.leecounty.iowa.gov/, https://www.leecounty.org/docview.aspx?docid=29749, https://www.leecounty.org/pview.aspx?id=20906&catid=0."
}